  "worked_solution": "Since we want to determine the rate of decrease in the amount of charge after $5$ hours, we have $t=5.$\n\nThus, the rate of decrease of the amount of charge after $5$ hours will be\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c(5) & =100\\cdot {5}^{-0.2(5)} \\\\  & =100\\cdot {5}^{-1} \\\\  & =\\frac{100}{5} \\\\  & =20.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the rate of decrease will be $20$ percent per hour.",
